## Definition of Done (Per Task)
- [ ] Requirement is documented and reviewed
- [ ] Accessibility impact checked (keyboard + contrast)
- [ ] Edge/error state documented
- [ ] Handoff notes added for implementation

## Discovery
- [ ] Define primary user personas and top 3 tasks
- [ ] List required screens/views and ownership
- [ ] Confirm accessibility baseline (WCAG target)

## Information Architecture
- [ ] Validate navigation structure (global, local, contextual)
- [ ] Define page hierarchy and routing conventions
- [ ] Document terminology and labels

## Interaction Design
- [ ] Define key user flows with happy-path and error-path states
- [ ] Specify control behavior (hover, focus, active, disabled)
- [ ] Define keyboard navigation and shortcuts

## Visual Design
- [ ] Establish typography scale and spacing system
- [ ] Define color tokens (primary, semantic, neutrals)
- [ ] Ensure contrast compliance for text and controls

## Components
- [ ] Identify reusable components and variants
- [ ] Document component states and validation rules
- [ ] Define empty/loading/error/success states

## Responsive & Adaptive
- [ ] Define breakpoints and layout behavior per breakpoint
- [ ] Validate touch targets and mobile interaction rules
- [ ] Confirm high-DPI and scaling behavior

## Accessibility
- [ ] Confirm semantic structure and ARIA usage
- [ ] Ensure focus order and visible focus indicators
- [ ] Provide alt text/content equivalents for non-text visuals

## Validation
- [ ] Run design review against acceptance criteria
- [ ] Run usability testing on critical flows
- [ ] Capture design debt and backlog follow-ups
